Subject: [PATCH 2/3] UI-only upgrade v128.06: enterprise shell and PiP layouts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Strict scope: HTML structure and CSS only — no changes to app-v4.js,
formulas, Firestore data paths, or quote save/load logic.

- Unified desk shell headers for Air/Sea (match Transport/Warehouse)
- Enhanced picture-in-picture results panels on all four desks
- Enquiry Database split: master list + sticky reports inspector
- Calmer logged-in surfaces; improved toast presentation
- All element IDs, handlers, and data bindings preserved unchanged
---
